    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those seeking a classic tower defense experience, Tower Petroleum delivers everything you love \u2014 towers, upgrades, waves of monsters, and strategic depth. But there\u2019s a twist: now it\u2019s also a deck-builder. Your cards shape your strategy, your heroes, and how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Petroleum has a narrative element to it. Every choice you make, guided by your moral compass, shapes the path ahead - influencing not just the story, but the entire way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different levels with different strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/312de0fdd88c4fe9e6da91ffcae981d5.avif?t=1754985541\" width=800 height=230 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck-building team assembling mechanic. Choose from a variety of unique heroes and powerful skills to either fortify your towers or unleash devastating attacks on monsters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/c95c022fba5e62d8ae451adff03e86ea.avif?t=1754985541\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep story with moral choices. Who will you become: a cold-blooded monster who does what it takes to try to save what left of human race or will you try to find compassion and kindness in those shivering deserts. Your choices will give you unique traits that will define your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/3f8135efb8c133ea0c1b363f9618013e.avif?t=1754985541\" width=800 height=369 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those seeking a classic tower defense experience, Tower Petroleum delivers everything you love \u2014 towers, upgrades, waves of monsters, and strategic depth. But there\u2019s a twist: now it\u2019s also a deck-builder. Your cards shape your strategy, your heroes, and how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Petroleum has a narrative element to it. Every choice you make, guided by your moral compass, shapes the path ahead - influencing not just the story, but the entire way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different levels with different strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/312de0fdd88c4fe9e6da91ffcae981d5.avif?t=1754985541\" width=800 height=230 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck-building team assembling mechanic. Choose from a variety of unique heroes and powerful skills to either fortify your towers or unleash devastating attacks on monsters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/c95c022fba5e62d8ae451adff03e86ea.avif?t=1754985541\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep story with moral choices. Who will you become: a cold-blooded monster who does what it takes to try to save what left of human race or will you try to find compassion and kindness in those shivering deserts. Your choices will give you unique traits that will define your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/3f8135efb8c133ea0c1b363f9618013e.avif?t=1754985541\" width=800 height=369 /></span></p></li></ul>",
